## Layout

```
src/
  index.ts          entrypoint (boots the fleet)
  discordApp.ts     the fleet: bots, channels, threads, Jarvis front door, in-thread delegation
  roster.ts         scans the workspace tree; base+overlay system prompt; getBots() fleet grouping
  executor.ts       runs an agent task via the Agent SDK (resume, ask_user, delegate, memory)
  delegateTool.ts   Jarvis's phase/parallel delegate tool
  agentConfig.ts    per-agent tool policy + cwd
  approval.ts       gated-tool approval handler
  memoryTool.ts     gated update_memory
  askUserTool.ts    ask_user (pause for a free-form reply)
  sessions.ts       thread/DM → SDK session id (resume)
  autopilot.ts      per-bot autonomous mode + always-allow
  tasks.ts / store.ts / inference.ts / util.ts
scripts/
  onboard-agent.ts  create app token → validate → store → invite URL (--all for batch)
```
